   "start": 16.804,
   "dur": 5.232,
   "speechStart": 16.902,
   "speechEnd": 21.211
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "听起来很快，可还是慢了一步。",
   "spoken": "听起来很快，可还是慢了一步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg1-04.mp3",
   "start": 22.256,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 22.354,
   "speechEnd": 24.544
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "Elliptic 估计，冻结生效之前，约 7.86 亿美元的稳定币，已经被换成了 ETH 和 TRX。",
   "spoken": "Elliptic 估计，冻结生效之前，约 7.86 亿美元的稳定币，已经被换成了 ETH 和 TRX。",
